===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Glaceon|238}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Ice Blade''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Empoleon|4}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

